if to say that they shouldn't skip ahead to the&nbsp;
point, that he already knows. He says that even&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:36.320 --> 00:09:42.400
if he told them, the straw hats wouldn't be able&nbsp;
to do anything about it the way they are now. Like&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:42.400 --> 00:09:46.640
dude, if Rayleigh knows what the straw&nbsp;
hats will become and tell them the truth,&nbsp;&nbsp;

