Toki of course is a super interesting character&nbsp;
in this context in particular. Why did she travel&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:54.960 --> 00:15:00.960
into the future from the void century? How did&nbsp;
she know where to travel to to meet oden? How&nbsp;&nbsp;

